<h3><u>Abbas-e-Ammu Jaanam</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>Abbas..<br />
Jane wafa-e-alam..(2)<br />
Abbas-e-ammu janam..(4)&nbsp;</p>

<p>Darya par tum jaao, paani lekar aao</p>

<p>Pyaase hai hum sab, pyaasa hai asghar</p>

<p>Abbas-e-ammu janam..(2)</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Wo darya behta hai, sab ka gala sukha hai</p>

<p>Tum bhi to pyase ho, baba bhi pyasa hai</p>

<p>Bhari ho lakho par..(2)</p>

<p>Abbas-e-ammu janam..(4)&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Lo ye alam mashkiza, mere pyare chacha</p>

<p>Tumko mili sakkai, qurbaa tumpe sakina</p>

<p>Ae saniy-e-haider..(2)</p>

<p>Abbas-e-ammu janam..(4)</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Sukhe hai sab kooze, samjhe bache kaise</p>

<p>Sahil par pehra hai, badal bhi na barse</p>

<p>Kab jaenge hum ghar..(2)</p>

<p>Abbas-e-ammu janam..(4)</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Kya fauje adaa hai, kya iska pehra hai</p>

<p>Tum ho saniy-e-haider, pyase ho to kya hai</p>

<p>Kya rokega lashkar..(2)</p>

<p>Abbas-e-ammu janam..(4)</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Jane lage jab ghazi, goonji aaho zaari</p>

<p>Lab pe dua-e-lekar, peeche chali shehzadi</p>

<p>Ehle haram nauhagar..(2)</p>

<p>Abbas-e-ammu janam..(4)</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Ammu laut ke aana, humko na rulwana</p>

<p>Rakhe khuda hum sab ke , sar pe alam ka saaya</p>

<p>Ae munis-o-yawar..(2)</p>

<p>Abbas-e-ammu janam..(4)</p>

<p>&nbsp;Bole ye rokar ghazi, wada karo ye bibi</p>

<p>Jab ye alam chup jae, aae alam jab khali</p>

<p>Na rona ye kehkar..(2)</p>

<p>Abbas-e-ammu janam..(4)</p>
</p>